            "best_answer": true,
            "best_answer_content": "Don't rely on the CubeMx figure, it's just a photo.\n\nPlease check the [datasheet](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/dm00037051.pdf) / Figure 76. LQFP64 - Outline\n\n![mALLEm_0-1775855630289.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/5373af38-77f3-c116-2422-8fc52d2fc60a.png \"mALLEm_0-1775855630289.png\")\n\nAnd this is pin 1:\n\n![mALLEm_1-1775855673525.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/4361a883-e4dc-752a-01cd-e13fa1297144.png \"mALLEm_1-1775855673525.png\").\n\nIn CubeMx: VBAT is indeed pin 1. But your reference of the package on the PCB is wrong.\n\n![mALLEm_0-1775856130578.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/0608c2fa-68e8-bfae-19f3-5fc3182b6ce2.png \"mALLEm_0-1775856130578.png\")",
            "best_answer_author": "mƎALLEm",
            "best_answer_author_role": "ST Technical Moderator",
            "content_text": "Hello everyone.\n\nI have recently made my own STM32 board based on the STM32F405. After soldering all the components and testing all pads and connections, finding them to be wired correctly and checking that the 3.3V is being supplied to all the correct pins, I tried to upload some code but to my shock the STM32F405 isn't establishing a connection via the ST-Link V2 nor the USB cable. After trying multiple fixes, I suspect the issue might be the STM32F405 chip that I got off AliExpress itself.\n\nSo before I took any further steps to replace it, I decided to post my schematics on here for review in case the problem was in my PCB design. If you have any remarks on what might have caused this problem, please share them.\n\nNOTE: The -B label is referring to ground, and P is the VCC.\n\nschematics:\n\n![rayboum_0-1775845016444.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/7f3f1485-bac7-7fd2-a716-9b015cdcbac8.png \"rayboum_0-1775845016444.png\")\n\n![rayboum_1-1775845042103.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/b3c1d531-07e8-f009-b969-432c21e040f7.png \"rayboum_1-1775845042103.png\")\n\n![rayboum_2-1775845090587.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/d3779200-a260-f9e8-7454-c3ef23236d06.png \"rayboum_2-1775845090587.png\")",
